    "body": "Perhaps a dumb question, but maybe the tests indicate that we should allow releasing the lock even with pending read requests? I'm not sure that restriction is super well-motivated, and if we've found at least one higher-level combinator (namely pipeTo) where doing so is arduous, there might be more.\r\n\r\nOtherwise, solving https://github.com/whatwg/streams/issues/1103 would make more sense...",
