    "body": "> Question: should pending reads be rejected with a TypeError or a AbortError DOMException?\r\n\r\nI slightly lean TypeError? We use it for a lot of similar situations in this spec, and now that abort reasons are a thing, we don't use AbortError DOMException directly at all.",
